    "_X5_note": "Error types are the vocabulary of failure. A file that names its errors has already begun to handle them. The act of declaring what can go wrong is the first step toward resilience.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Proverbs 27:12 — A prudent man foreseeth the evil, and hideth himself; but the simple pass on, and are punished."
